@host = http://localhost:5005

### The whole directory, Norwegian, first page
GET {{host}}/api/resources

### English
GET {{host}}/api/resources?lang=en

### Free-text search
GET {{host}}/api/resources?search=krisesenter

### Two categories (OR) in one municipality — national services come along
GET {{host}}/api/resources?category=okonomi&category=bolig&municipality=1

### A mistyped language still returns the directory, in Norwegian
GET {{host}}/api/resources?lang=klingon

### One service
GET {{host}}/api/resources/1

### A service that does not exist — 404 with ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/resources/9999

### Categories and municipalities
GET {{host}}/api/categories?lang=en

###
GET {{host}}/api/municipalities
